`,u.jsx(a.h2,{children:"What is Zonal Architecture?"}),`
`,u.jsx(a.p,{children:"Zonal architecture is a modern automotive design that organizes a vehicle's electronics by physical location (zones like front-left, rear-right) instead of by function, using fewer, powerful zonal controllers to manage nearby sensors and actuators"}),`
